  data: {
    LLM: "Remember the unusual card ranking (3-2-Ace are high). Try to capture 3s, 2s, and Aces. In bidding, only bid if you have strong cards.\n\nWhen calling a partner, call a card you don't have but suspect an opponent might. Use the monte exchange to improve your hand composition. Try to deduce who your partner is from their plays.\n\nCard counting is essential - track all 3s, 2s, and Aces. As the secret partner, give subtle signals through your card play. Time your high cards to win critical tricks.",
